# Arena scale (16000 across) and pad tuning. Checks walls are drawn near the player only,
# textures read left to right from inside, and speed/size tuning reach the game.
wait 15.5
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
shot scale_1_centre
# C x13: cruise 7 -> 20 units/frame (1200/s), then drive north to the wall (~6.6 s)
press c 13
wait 7.5
shot scale_2_north_wall_iso
# Down: 1st person, facing the north wall up close
press down
wait 0.5
shot scale_3_north_wall_1st
# Right: face east, looking along the north wall towards the corner
press right
wait 1
shot scale_4_along_wall_1st
# L x7: shrink to the smallest arena (2000 across); the cycle is pulled inside
press l 7
wait 1
shot scale_5_shrunk
